==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

